{"id":"n18779-1-9","stage":1,"title":"고양이 · 猫","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18779-1-9-1","ko":"승규야, 넌 무슨 동물을 좋아하니?","zh":"承奎，你喜欢什么动物呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동물을","meaning":"动物","explanation":"동물：动物；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"동물","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70747","senseId":"1","lemma":"동물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아하니?","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"227e25cceb2f8449","term":"동물","zh":"动物","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3","entryId":"70747","definition":"在生物界的两条分支中，从食物中获取营养，并可以自由活动的生物。","pronunciation":["동ː물"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4fb37f57911c4284af30.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18779-1-9-2","ko":"난 귀엽고 재롱이 많은 고양이가 좋아.","zh":"我喜欢可爱又机灵的猫。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"귀엽고","meaning":"可爱","explanation":"귀엽다：可爱；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"귀엽다","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38323","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀엽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재롱이","meaning":"逗人，逗乐，耍宝","explanation":"재롱：逗人，逗乐，耍宝；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"재롱","audio":"/audio/73797936540713f49c34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74491","senseId":"1","lemma":"재롱","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고양이가","meaning":"猫","explanation":"고양이：猫；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고양이","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18779","senseId":"1","lemma":"고양이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f6866c147cb407d9","term":"귀엽다","zh":"可爱","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3","entryId":"38323","definition":"看起来漂亮，或令人喜爱。","pronunciation":["귀ː엽따"]},{"id":"73797936540713f4","term":"재롱","zh":"逗人，逗乐，耍宝","audio":"/audio/73797936540713f49c34.mp3","entryId":"74491","definition":"小孩子的可爱的话或行动。","pronunciation":["재롱"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"2c4930ad509e4bdc","term":"고양이","zh":"猫","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3","entryId":"18779","definition":"一种可以家养的小动物，在黑暗的地方也能看清事物，擅长捉老鼠。","pronunciation":["고양이"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/83317d2c0621f8acf131.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18779","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.7588,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我喜欢可爱又机灵的猫。","承奎，你喜欢什么动物呀？","这么冷，把门关上怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎，你喜欢什么动物呀？","这么冷，把门关上怎么样？","我喜欢可爱又机灵的猫。"],"answer":2}]}
